WEBVTT

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.930
Oh, Kuromine-kun.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:09.590
Morning.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.820
Sh-Shiragami...

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.400
M-Morning.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.160
Yup, morning.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:17.290
Is this when you always leave for school?

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.540
Yeah.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.040
But this is the first time 
we're going together, huh?

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.660
Now that you mention it, yeah, it is.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:26.470
<i>I guess that makes sense.</i>

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.040
<i>Since Shiragami's a vampire,</i>

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.610
<i>she usually goes to school 
before the sun rises.</i>

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:35.080
Sh-Shiragami, are you okay?

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.650
Huh? How do you mean?

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.390
You said it yourself.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.540
You tan really easily when you're in the sun.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.890
And it's way past sunrise already.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.640
Oh, that...

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.480
O-Oh, right.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.560
Use my umbrella, too.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.600
I'll be fine, Kuromine-kun.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:56.910
I do go to school before it gets bright,

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:59.040
but it's going to rain all day today.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.340
There's no way it'll clear up 
before we get there.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:03.290
So I'm totally fine.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.250
Y-Yeah, you're right.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:10.120
You'd know better than anyone 
whether it's okay or not.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.050
Exactly.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.790
It's not like I slept in or anything.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.280
<i>So that's why...</i>

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:51.020
<b>Let's Go on a... Date?</b>

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.660
Let's Go on a... Date?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.360
It cleared up.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:59.270
This is one case where the forecast 
being wrong makes me happy.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:01.280
Morning, Aizawa-san.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:03.530
Morni—

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:07.530
Did you go swimming at 
the beach or something?

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.480
Stupid weather forecast.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:13.780
First of all,

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:15.890
UV rays, which are the cause of suntan,

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:17.710
pass through clouds.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.870
I believe this is considered common knowledge.

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:27.100
Is this not especially important 
to you, Shiragami Youko?

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:30.030
Ah, I never knew.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:32.850
Is that why you've always skipped out

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.460
on outdoor P.E. classes?

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.310
Yeah.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:39.940
I wouldn't want people to 
see me getting dark so fast.

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:43.390
I go back to normal after some sleep, though.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:47.330
So is your skin sensitive or not?

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:51.520
Given that I'm an alien, 
I hesitate to say this,

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.440
but I find it slightly hard 
to believe that just walking

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.210
to school would cause such a suntan.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.690
You really didn't go to the beach?

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:04.090
Yeah, see, my suntan is in 
the shape of my uniform.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.480
Eromine Asahi,

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.730
you understand why I hit you, do you not?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.990
S-Sorry.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:25.170
But I understand now, Shiragami Youko.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.120
To you, sunlight is

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.910
a barrage of bullets raining upon you.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:31.700
What?

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.330
It brings back memories

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:38.840
of my days spent in arduous 
training on my home planet.

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.280
That's kinda awesome.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.190
I wish I could be like you.

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:46.400
Very well.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.720
Shiragami Youko,

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.600
I shall hereby teach you

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.600
the art of survival!

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.970
Y-Yes, please do,

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:54.730
Aizawa-san!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.390
Wrong!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:56.550
Call me Instructor!

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:57.860
Yes, Instructor!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.640
Let us begin your training.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:06.190
You're going to learn how to deal 
with enemy bullets aimed at you.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:07.280
Are you ready?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:10.280
Y-Yes, I am, Instructor!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:13.370
<i>I've only ever seen her be 
a spectator in her track suit.</i>

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.960
<i>Seeing her in P.E. clothes is fresh, too.</i>

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.380
<i>Thank you, Class Rep.</i>

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:20.680
Listen up.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.240
You will go to the target site,

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:24.890
the school, avoiding enemy bullets along the way.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.480
For that, you need a protective barrier.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:31.750
That is, you need to move 
smoothly from shadow to shadow.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:32.890
Yes, Instructor!

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.680
You must run from this shade

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.030
to that shade in the brief lapses in enemy fire.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.270
Yes, Instructor!

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:41.320
There are <i>always</i>

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.630
opportunities to make it

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.530
from shade to shade!

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:57.860
The enemy fire isn't lapsing, Instructor!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:59.270
Impossible!

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:01.960
Is the enemy arsenal inexhaustible?

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:04.460
<i>This is looking worse than I thought!</i>

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.470
Forget it!

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.890
A little damage is to be expected!

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:08.690
Charge!

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.180
Yes, Instructor!

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.560
That's it! It's in the dive!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.280
Th-This is already getting kinda haphazard.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.560
That's the idea!

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.820
I'm getting the hang of it.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.690
Good, that's the spirit.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.510
Unyielding spirit!

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:33.340
You're completely scorched already!

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:43.590
Those two apparently kept 
training until nighttime.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.700
I guess it's not surprising that 
Shiragami would be so desperate.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:51.220
I thought I could help her 
out somehow too, but...

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.800
The more I read up on

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:57.140
vampires' weaknesses, the more I find.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:01.400
<b>Field Guide to Vampires</b>

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:01.400
She must have had it rough all this time.

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:04.110
Kuromine-kun.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.400
Sh-Shiragami.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.730
I made it this far unscathed.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:10.760
But why are you in your P.E. clothes?

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.870
Morning, Kuromine Asahi.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.210
Huh? You're here too, Class Rep?

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:17.360
She stayed over at my place last night.

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:20.870
Only to see how trainee 
Shiragami has progressed.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.740
And isn't your suntan gone?

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:26.240
I told you, it goes away after a night's sleep.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.500
Oh, right.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:29.680
Trainee Shiragami.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:30.460
Ma'am!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.280
Your training is complete.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:34.240
I have nothing more to teach you.

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:36.460
Thank you, Instructor!

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:39.270
Now, go and show them
the results of your training!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.680
Yes, Instructor!

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.570
<i>Shiragami's more serious 
than she's ever been.</i>

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:54.780
<i>I must never let myself be 
discouraged by sudden adversity.</i>

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.490
<i>At times, I must be careful,</i>

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:00.410
<i>and...</i>

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.620
<i>at times, I must be bold!</i>

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.620
<b>Baked Sweet Potatoes</b>

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.280
Shiragami!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:14.760
Maybe she's fighting an evil organization.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:15.180
<b>Ohisama Street</b>

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.730
Good judgment, Shiragami Youko.

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:25.400
Here, the roof will protect
you from enemy fire...

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:26.980
What is it?

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.420
Why are you stopping?

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:30.860
I-It's...

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.490
Garlic!

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:35.410
I think garlic makes vampires...

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.200
go blind!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.680
Oh, no!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.200
Welcome.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.390
Would you kids like one?

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.370
It's pickled garlic.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.090
I'll have all of it, sir!

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:53.600
Putting on stamina for your 
girlfriend so early in the day?

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.090
Oh, to be young.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:58.480
Sorry! But it's nothing like that!

00:08:58.480 --> 00:08:59.930
What was that about?

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:02.620
Well, I ate the garlic for Shiragami's sake...

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:04.640
Oh, hey there, young lady.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.520
This would look great on you.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:08.690
A cross!

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:12.690
They say a cross will turn a vampire to ash!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:16.280
Young lady, this can be 
yours for just 2,000 yen.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:17.660
Shiragami!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.080
I'll buy it!

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:22.330
What?!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:27.870
Oh my God!

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:32.680
Now what?

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.340
It's a cross!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.560
A vampire's greatest weakness!

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.560
The cross!

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:44.350
Shiragami!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.600
Run!

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:46.830
Good doggie.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:49.960
Shiragami!

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:52.070
Aren't crosses a danger to you?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:52.980
I'm fine.

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:56.490
They just kinda make me 
angry when I look at them.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:02.820
You smell.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.220
Yeah, you do.

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:06.360
Sorry.

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:08.850
You can't take the smell 
of garlic either, can you?

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.170
I'll walk separately.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.080
No, it doesn't bother me.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.800
It just makes my eyes a bit watery.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.570
O-Okay.

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:20.430
Well, I'm glad it's nothing serious,

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.110
but I'm beat.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:24.240
Still, we were careless.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:27.310
I never imagined there'd be 
so many traps around the city.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.380
In any case, I have to make 
it through this training.

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.270
I won't let anything beat me!

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.150
Th-There's...

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.370
...not a single spot of shade.

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:42.250
That's as far as I go.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.640
Why is it that

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:48.470
I'm fine with garlic and crosses 
and all the other stuff,

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:50.790
but I can't handle sunlight?

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:51.920
But...

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:55.060
If I can just overcome that,

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:57.710
there's one place I really want to go.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.200
Where's that?

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.720
Oh, it's nothing that special.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.140
Don't worry about it.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.760
Wait.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.500
If you can't avoid the sunlight,

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.380
you could wear armor instead.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:10.640
Armor?

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:13.410
It's akin to what you Earthlings call a spacesuit.

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:15.480
She has to go to school in a spacesuit?!

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:22.810
What if she covered herself with 
those black UV filter sheets instead?

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.870
That's even more unrealistic.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.160
I know.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.870
How about we make her an 
external unit, like mine?

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:31.470
Although hers may end up a bit large.

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:34.040
No, that'd be way too huge!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.800
Besides, what would she do at school?

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.960
Then what else do you propose?

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.720
It's all right, you guys.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.650
Thanks, though,

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.760
for doing so much for me.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:49.140
I consider myself lucky.

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:52.770
Shiragami...

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:54.840
I'll just give up and go to school

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:58.000
before the sun rises, like I always have.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.030
B-But...

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.600
<i>Isn't there something?</i>

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:04.800
<i>Some way Shiragami can 
be freed from sunlight?</i>

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:11.920
Hey, isn't there any sunblock 
that works on vampires?

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:14.710
We wouldn't have had to go 
through all this if there were.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.540
Yeah, you're right.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.540
Sunblock...

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.090
Shiragami-san?

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:26.890
No, surely you've tried sunblock already, right?

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:29.480
Y-Yeah, of course I have!

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:32.070
Jeez, come on!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:39.410
Here I go!

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:41.040
Her skin is light.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.320
It is.

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:50.990
Shiragami!

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:54.150
Shiragami Youko,

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.200
you've...

00:12:57.160 --> 00:13:00.170
I couldn't bring myself to tell you two.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.290
Actually, I've...

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:06.800
never tried sunblock before.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:09.180
No, we already figured that out.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.520
No way!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.980
<b>What are you doing            What?!                                                 How did I get bitten here?
getting your blood
sucked by a mosquito?
Aren't you the vampire?</b>

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.980
<b>Bug bite</b>

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.940
<i>Wh-What's going on?</i>

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:21.610
<i>Shiragami actually invited me 
to an amusement park?</i>

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.260
<i>Isn't this a d-date?</i>

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.590
<i>No, knowing Shiragami,</i>

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:29.540
<i>she probably just really wanted 
to come to the amusement park.</i>

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:32.660
<i>No, but it wouldn't hurt to get 
my hopes up a little, right?</i>

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.880
Sorry, Kuromine-kun.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.080
Sh-Shiragami.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:37.540
Sorry.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.980
Did you wait long?

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:40.590
<i>Shiragami in casual clothes!</i>

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.810
<i>P.E. clothes and ponytails are nice too,</i>

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:45.970
<i>but today she's in her ordinary clothes!</i>

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:48.900
This is even more rare!

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.580
What's up, Kuromine-kun?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:53.080
Oh, nothing. Nothing at all.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.640
I just got here.

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:55.790
Nah,

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.320
no way you went through all 
those cans if you just got here.

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:02.280
One more thing I have to apologize for...

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:05.190
Aizawa-san had urgent business, 
so she couldn't make it.

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:07.860
You invited the class rep, too?

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:14.360
My "Operation: Excitement Between 
Kuromine-kun and Aizawa-san" is a failure.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.250
<i>S-So that's what it was...</i>

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:20.000
<i>I keep telling her there's nothing 
between me and the class rep.</i>

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.500
What should we do?

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:26.100
It ended up just the two of us 
at the amusement park.

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:28.060
W-Well, I, uh...

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.320
I wanted to go, so...

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.310
I thought it was just 
us two at first, anyway.

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:35.100
Uh, I mean, we're here now, so...

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.320
Y-You're right.

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:38.980
As long as we're here!

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:40.940
<b>Amusement and
Theme Park Guide</b>

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.940
<i>That's a lot of pages marked!</i>

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:43.940
<i>She must have really been
looking forward to it.</i>

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.740
Come on, let's go, Kuromine-kun.

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.200
Right.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.390
Kuromine Asahi,

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:59.630
enjoy your time together 
with Shiragami Youko.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.500
But what is...

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.620
this feeling?

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:17.720
This is my first time coming 
to a place like this.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.810
It's all because of the sunblock.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.960
Shiragami, Shiragami!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.570
Sorry, I'm not hearing a word you're saying.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.380
I'm scared! I'm scared!

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:28.940
No, Kuromine-kun!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:29.810
Talk to me!

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:31.520
This is bad!

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:33.530
I have to keep him distracted!

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:51.600
W-Was it that scary?

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.930
We're already off to a bad start.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.490
Sorry, I guess a roller coaster 
was too much to start with.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:00.350
Let's go for something easier next.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.730
I can handle anything with you...

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:05.480
I mean, I don't mind anything.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.230
Then...

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.240
How about a looping roller coaster?!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.990
You're completely hooked on thrill rides!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.920
Shiragami, your wings! Your wings!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.290
That was so much fun.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:26.920
Yeah...

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.120
To be honest,

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:32.720
I've always wanted to come here, 
even if it had to be by myself.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:34.800
So then...

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:38.300
There's one place I really want to go.

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.560
You were talking about this amusement park?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.140
Yup.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:42.520
I see.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.670
Because you've never been to one before.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:47.230
That's part of it, but...

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.720
I guess it's because

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:52.200
I heard my mom and dad had a date here.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.650
Isn't your dad...

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:56.240
Yeah, a vampire.

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:01.380
Oh, yeah...

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:05.580
Strictly speaking, I'm half-human, half-vampire.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.680
Then your mom is...

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:10.320
Yeah, she's human.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:11.710
What? Seriously?

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:14.490
Dad doesn't like to talk about it,

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:16.930
but Mom told me a lot.

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.980
It's like a drama, right?

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:22.270
A romance between a human and a vampire.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:25.000
He has to hide his vampire identity,

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:29.260
and they overcome all kinds of 
challenges and prejudices together.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:34.560
I chose our school because it's 
where my mom and dad went.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.840
It's kind of stupid, isn't it?

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.820
Who chooses their high school like that?

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.720
No, it isn't.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.050
Are you sure?

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:43.470
Really, though,

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:46.330
your dad went to a human school too, huh?

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:47.730
Yeah.

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.510
That's kind of familiar, huh?

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:52.570
Like, you're keeping my secret, too.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:53.340
And...

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:57.420
Mom and Dad kept his secret together, too,

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:59.250
and then fell in love.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.880
S-Sorry, never mind.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.800
I didn't mean it like that.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:05.180
It's—

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:07.140
No, I—

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:09.730
It's not like that, okay? Yeah.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:13.040
Look, there. Let's go there next!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.580
O-Okay...

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.540
Come on, let's go!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.070
<b>Haunted House</b>

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:23.940
<i>A haunted house now, huh?</i>

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:24.750
<i>Then again,</i>

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.450
<i>Shiragami's a vampire,</i>

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:27.730
<i>so this probably isn't...</i>

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:29.250
<i>She's completely freaking out!</i>

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.070
Hey, Shiragami,

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:34.220
if you're scared, um,

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:37.200
you can hold my hand.

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:39.150
I'm totally fine with this stuff!

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:41.050
I'm a cool beauty.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:42.640
C-Cool beauty?

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.670
Th-That's right.

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.390
<i>No, you're lying.</i>

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.550
I-It feels like the atmosphere just changed.

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:53.310
D-Did it?

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.960
Hey, Shiragami—

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.660
Wh-What?

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.020
What was that?

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.910
I-It's pretend.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.160
It's just pretend.

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:07.480
They're just scaring us with loud noises.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:10.250
R-Really? Thank goodness...

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:15.760
S-Sorry!

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:17.300
N-No, I'm sorry!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.220
<i>I was so close to her...</i>

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:23.180
<i>And... I felt something soft!</i>

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:27.470
Blood...

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:30.160
Blood...

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.900
Give me your blood!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:38.120
How could you be so rude, 
asking to suck some stranger's blood?

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:38.650
Huh?

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.360
Huh?

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:41.430
No, even if we weren't strangers,

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:43.020
that's totally rude!

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:45.620
I-I'm sorry!

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.540
Seriously, how rude.

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.330
Asking to suck my blood out of nowhere...

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:52.460
<i>R-Rude?</i>

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:55.340
<i>Oh, right, sucking blood is...</i>

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:58.800
It means you're pledging your love for them.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.720
It's like a kiss.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.060
<i>She did say that, didn't she?</i>

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:10.890
<b>Exit</b>

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:09.440
That wasn't a big deal.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:10.890
Y-Yeah.

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:12.820
I wonder if that vampire back there

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.540
was from where I came from.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.610
Nah, he's a fake.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:20.210
I wonder how Mom and Dad are doing.

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:23.560
You're probably the first person
to feel nostalgic about home

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:25.070
at a haunted house.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:30.830
<i>I really got to see a new side 
of Shiragami today, though.</i>

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:34.460
<i>She's never told me about her parents before.</i>

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.480
What's wrong, Kuromine-kun?

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:37.420
Uh, nothing!

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.040
I was just wondering,

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.780
are there things besides vampires,

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:45.850
like invisible people and wolf men 
and stuff, where you come from?

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:47.260
There are.

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:50.430
I guess the wolf man and I are

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:53.020
kind of like Akemi-san and you.

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:54.760
Huh? Me and Mikan?

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:56.520
So you're victim and attacker?

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.200
No, I mean,

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:01.120
we're childhood friends.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:03.860
My childhood friend is a wolf man.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:06.350
<i>Wolf man...</i>

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:08.620
<i>"Man"?</i>

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:12.620
<i>Shiragami has a male childhood friend?!</i>

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:18.500
<b>Shiragami</b>

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:18.500
Thanks for taking the time to come here.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:20.720
No problem, boss.

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:22.260
Is it about Youko?

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.480
Indeed.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:28.210
I simply can't believe that 
fool can keep her secret.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:31.840
Would you go check on her?

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.550
Yes, boss.

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:37.470
If it looks like Youko isn't keeping her secret,

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:43.850
end her school life without mercy.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:45.360
Understood.

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:47.680
When that happens, boss,

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:50.110
give me Youko.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:24.460
<b><i>Actually I Am</i> Spot-the-Difference!</b>

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:24.460
Let's play <i>Actually I Am</i> Spot-the-Difference!

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:26.760
There are three differences here.

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:28.160
There's no ribbon.

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:30.200
I've already found all three.

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.070
I found one, too.

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:33.110
Here.

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:34.470
Not bad, Shiragami Youko.

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:35.880
That leaves one more...

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:38.260
Pathetic, Kuromine Asahi.

00:23:38.260 --> 00:23:39.920
This Shiragami Youko

00:23:39.920 --> 00:23:41.950
just had lunch!

00:23:42.590 --> 00:23:44.720
Who would notice that?!

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:46.290
No, look carefully.

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:48.170
She has a bit of a belly.

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:50.900
<b>Next Episode:
"Beware of the Wolf Man!"</b>

00:23:48.170 --> 00:23:50.370
Stop staring!
